    "detailed_description": "A roguelike  tower defense game with backpack management and route planning, while also incorporating a number of innovative gameplay elements<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2>Design enemy pathways by combining buildings and walls (enemies will move between buildings);<br>Buildings have various tags, and they can be upgraded and starred;<br>Enhance their abilities by arranging buildings (rotating &amp; moving) to maximize their potential (the more stars, the better);<br>Buildings can be placed on walls to make the most of space;<br>Semi-turn-based, players can only operate (shop &amp; plan) when upgrading, otherwise, it's a idle game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Further Notes:</h2>Due to production costs, the game doesn't have a lot of content, so it's completely free;<br>The development time was short, and there were only two developers, please be understanding and engage in discussions;<br>For any issues, you can leave a comment on Youtube or send me a private message.",
